# The keys (spec, Controls: Keys, three zones), one expect a row, each through the Mac's way (UIState):
# - F3..B3, the voices in role order Pluck 1, Pluck 2, Bass, Pad, Lead, Drone, Heartbeat: a tap mutes and unmutes
#   (the transport's mute), brings in a voice the arranger holds back (WAITS: setVoiceActive on, at the next bar);
#   held, the voice is selected, and with EDIT / REC / SEL it is regenerated (an undo point first) / blanked for a
#   cycle / locked. A role the template lacks: its key dark, inert.
# - C4..B4 white, the degrees 1-7: transpose(degreeOffset: n - 1) at the next bar (pending, then current).
# - C#4 D#4 F#4 G#4 A#4, the template's CC scenes in its order (Ambient drift's two: closed, open), over 8 bars from
#   the next bar; past them, and on a template without any, nothing.
# - C5..F5, the slots 1-6: a tap recalls at the next bar (an undo point first); SAVE + a slot stores (SAVE then does
#   not save); an empty one says so; a third recall in one bar finds the engine's queue full and says so.
# - F#5: >> (advancePhase, at the next bar). G5: one unit of tension (on the pad, else the first voice), lit while
#   some is left.
# Expect names: mutedV activeV (1 playing, 0 WAITS, -1 not in the running engine) lockedV genV reqV (0 none, 1
# blank, 2 regenerate) blankV for voice key V (0-6); key_ledK (key K: 0 off, 1 dim, 2 lit); warns (what was
# refused, said).
#
# The Demo trio (Pluck 1, Pluck 2, Bass) on a seed of the test's, 90 BPM: a bar is 2667 ms, tick 0 100 ms after PLAY.
proj template demo 0x5EED1234
wait 50
expect key_led0 2
expect key_led2 2
expect key_led3 0
expect key_led6 0
tap PLAY
wait 500
expect playing 1
# ---- voices: a tap mutes, again unmutes; the key dark while muted
tapkey 2
expect muted2 1
expect key_led2 0
tapkey 2
expect muted2 0
expect key_led2 2
# a role the Demo trio lacks: nothing (Pad, Lead, Drone, Heartbeat)
tapkey 3
tapkey 4
tapkey 5
tapkey 6
expect muted3 0
expect muted6 0
expect warns 0
# held a second: selected, not muted
key 1 down
expect voice_sel 1
wait 1100
key 1 up
expect voice_sel 1
expect muted1 0
# held + SEL: locked; again: unlocked (the key not tapped)
key 2 down
tap SEL
key 2 up
expect locked2 1
expect muted2 0
key 2 down
tap SEL
key 2 up
expect locked2 0
# held + EDIT: the bass regenerated at its loop boundary, an undo point first
expect gen2 1
expect undo_depth 0
key 2 down
tap EDIT
key 2 up
expect undo_depth 1
expect req2 2
expect muted2 0
wait 3000
expect req2 0
expect gen2 2
# held + REC: a blank cycle for Pluck 1 at its loop boundary (no undo point)
key 0 down
tap REC
key 0 up
expect req0 1
expect undo_depth 1
wait 3000
expect req0 0
expect blank0 1
# ---- the degrees: D4 (degree 2) pending until the next bar, then current
expect degree 1
expect pending_degree 0
tapkey w5
expect pending_degree 2
expect degree 1
wait 2700
expect degree 2
expect pending_degree 0
expect key_led9 2
expect key_led7 0
tapkey w4
wait 2700
expect degree 1
# ---- the scenes: the Demo trio has none, the keys do nothing
tapkey b3
tapkey b7
expect key_led8 0
expect warns 0
# ---- the slots: SAVE + C#5 stores slot 2 (no save), lit
press SAVE
tapkey 20
release SAVE
expect slot_used1 1
expect store_writes 0
expect key_led20 2
expect key_led19 0
expect slot_pat1_hi 0xd5447eaa
expect slot_pat1_lo 0x0c3f13f6
# the patterns change (Pluck 2 regenerated), then slot 2 recalled at the next bar: its patterns back
key 1 down
tap EDIT
key 1 up
wait 6000
expect undo_depth 2
expect pat_hash_hi 0xbf0a5ab0
tapkey 20
expect undo_depth 3
wait 2700
expect pat_hash_hi 0xd5447eaa
expect pat_hash_lo 0x0c3f13f6
# an empty slot: said, nothing else
tapkey 21
expect warns 1
expect undo_depth 3
# three recalls in one bar: the engine holds two, the third is refused and said
wait 1500
tapkey 20
tapkey 20
tapkey 20
expect warns 2
# ---- G5: tension, on Pluck 1 here (the Demo trio has no pad), lit while some is left
expect tension_left 2
expect key_led26 2
tapkey 26
wait 2700
expect tension_left 1
tapkey 26
wait 2700
expect tension_left 0
expect key_led26 0
tap PLAY
# ---- Ambient drift (72 BPM: a bar is 3333 ms): the arranger holds voices back (WAITS), its two scenes, >>
proj template ambient 0x0A3B11ED
wait 50
expect key_led8 1
expect key_led10 1
expect key_led13 0
tap PLAY
wait 500
expect arr_phase 0
expect active5 1
expect active3 0
tapkey 3
expect muted3 0
wait 3400
expect active3 1
# C#4: toward the closed scene from the next bar, its key lit; A#4 (a fifth scene): nothing
tapkey b3
tapkey b7
wait 3400
expect key_led8 2
expect key_led10 1
# >>: the arranger's next change at the next bar, long before its own (its period is 8 bars at least): in the
# build, the next voice of its order joins, Pluck 1, then Pluck 2
expect active0 0
expect active1 0
tapkey 25
wait 3400
expect arr_phase 0
expect active0 1
expect active1 0
tapkey 25
wait 3400
expect active1 1
# WAITS blinks, a voice in plays lit: Pluck 2 is in now, the Bass not in the template
expect key_led1 2
expect key_led2 0
tap PLAY
